00:31:05.180 --> 00:31:06.890
We don't do that
guarantee anymore.

00:31:06.890 --> 00:31:12.770
But officially, Python 2 end
of life is January 1, 2020.

00:31:12.770 --> 00:31:16.070
So it's time to
look at your codes,

